<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Council may at any time revoke the appointment of any member of a committee. Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
