<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Council or against any member or agent of the Council in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by him in such capacity. Public servant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_II__cl_15> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_II> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
