<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Until a seal is provided by the Council, a stamp bearing the words “Malaysian Food Analysts Council” may be used and shall be deemed to be its common seal."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
