<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_IV__cl_27__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of satisfying itself that any registered food analyst is incapable, by reason of physical or mental infirmity, of carrying out his duties, the Council shall appoint a Medical Review Committee which shall consist of not less than two medical practitioners and one food analyst appointed by the Council to inquire into each case and to make such recommendations as the Committee deems proper. Alteration to the Register"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
