<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_I__cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall not apply to the chemists registered under the Chemists Act 1975."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
