<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who is not registered as a food analyst under this Act commits an offence if he—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
