<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An authorized officer conducting a search under this Act shall be given access to computerized data whether stored in a computer or otherwise."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
