<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_39__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In this section, “access” includes being provided with the necessary password, encryption code, decryption code, software or hardware and any other means required to enable comprehension of computerized data. Power to require attendance of person acquainted with case"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
