<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An authorized officer making an investigation under this Act may, by order in writing require the attendance before himself of any person who appears to the authorized officer to be acquainted with the facts and circumstances of the case, and such person shall attend as so required."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_40__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
