<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@/~part_VI__cl_42__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the accused had made a statement during the course of an investigation, such statement may be admitted in evidence in support of his defence during the course of the trial."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/34/eng@> .
